summary:
“Are you human?” Jones asks stiffly.Jack scoffs again. “Obviously.”Jones gives him a somewhat reprimanding look, as if to say no, it isn’t. Jack winces. “I’m not—” His throat kind of catches. “I’m not an animal. I don’t bite.”“That’s not what they told me.”Shit. The thing is, they’re right. He did bite his first warden. More specifically, he tore the guy’s throat out with his teeth.Jack announces, perhaps idiotically, “I won’t bite you.”
 //
Locked in the cells of Torchwood Three, Jack receives a new handler by the name of Ianto Jones. Somehow, this one seems different than the rest.

"Who's gonna save my soul, when your love runs cold" ;
"Who's gonna bring me back into my orbit？";
The doctor, the time traveller, the warrior, my lover.
 
